## Limits And Additional Notes

- All four entries are inherited unchanged from the authentic before; no alias or history has been edited.
- CHEBI28869 and CAS58-27-5 menadione remain intact. ATCC1257 solute/stock distinction remains separately scoped and all existing holds remain.
- Database and manufacturer naming assertions are evidence of actual usage, not independent experimental votes. Repeated captures and cross-referencing sources are not multiplied as independent approvals.
- No fabricated SKU, lot assay, universal brand scope, guessed menadiol/bisulfite/phylloquinone identity or source absence claim.
- Search coverage is bounded to logged requests and inspected documents. Failed retrievals remain explicit. W01 full-row review and coordinator admission are separate.
- Whole original source PDFs are retained, but only cited relevant sections were scientifically inspected; bibliography links are not read-paper evidence.
- Unavailable raw HTTP bodies and tool-rendered sources are distinguished in original ledgers. No full product-composition result is inferred from unsuccessful retrievals.
- Private native overlay uses unchanged native inspect/validate/dump/render/parse/read primitives. Canonical save_review is not invoked because user confines output to ignored private research directory; no REPORT_ROOT or Git environment override.
- source.git_revision is actual W02 basec91ccac1; working_tree inputs are immutable private captures. W08ae1d selected owner and before84241993 Git blobs have separate exact receipts.
- Raw captures are evidence, not extra votes. Four-token science flag does not confer owner/role/source-case/application/export approval.

